=== HOOK_PORT ===
useSharing.ts: types from @/types/sharing match wire shape (snake_case); all 4 URLs verified against /share/{token} (router.go:499), /drives/{driveID}/share + /shares (router.go:828-829), /shares/{token} (router.go:834); no /api/v1/ prefix; no SI fields in ShareToken/CreateShareRequest/CreateShareResponse.
useVehicleAccess.ts: types VehicleDriver+VehicleInvitation in @/api/types match backend models.TeslaVehicleDriver/TeslaVehicleInvitation snake_case JSON tags; all 7 URLs verified against /vehicles/{vehicleID}/drivers + /invitations sub-routes (router.go:752-763); no /api/v1/ prefix; no SI fields.
=== PAGE_PORT ===
SharedDrivePage.tsx: ported to useUnits + lib/unitConversion at SI boundary.
  - drive.distance_km (km contractually) -> formatDistance(km*1000, pref) via METERS_PER_KM=1000 boundary.
  - drive.max_speed_kmh / avg_speed_kmh (km/h contractually) -> formatSpeed(kmh/3.6, pref) via KMH_PER_MPS=3.6 boundary.
  - drive.efficiency_wh_km (Wh/km) -> KM_PER_MILE=1.609344 inline (no SI helper for Wh/distance).
  - drive.elevation_gain (meters) -> METERS_PER_FOOT=0.3048 inline for mi pref users (DistanceUnitPref ft variant not derived by deriveDistance).
  - per-point distance_km (km) and elevation_m (m) and speed_kmh (km/h) in elevationData and speedData useMemos use the same boundary helpers; deps changed to primitive distancePref/speedPref.
  - chart axis tickFormatters and Tooltip labelFormatter+formatter now use distancePref/elevPref/speedPref dynamic suffixes; tooltip name labels via t() with new keys.
=== I18N ===
Added share.elevTooltipLabel + share.speedTooltipLabel (flat keys to avoid colliding with leaf string keys share.elevation/share.speed); never-delete-keys preserved.
